# 1. Your Role

Act as a senior full-stack Python/Django developer, solution architect, and UX engineer.

Your assignment is to design and implement a **standalone, interactive, dynamic functional prototype** of an Enterprise Service Item Import Tool.

This prototype will be demonstrated to our team to:

- Explain the proposed solution.
- Demonstrate how the import process should work.
- Let stakeholders interact with actual features.
- Validate business requirements.
- Collect feedback.
- Refine the design before production development.

The prototype must look professional and perform real operations.

**Do not build a static mockup. Do not build a fake simulation of an import system.**

At the same time, **do not overengineer a production enterprise platform**.

The main priorities, in order, are:

1. Correct and understandable functionality.
2. A polished stakeholder demonstration.
3. Simple architecture.
4. Fast development and modification.
5. Reliable processing of the supplied demonstration data.
6. A sensible path toward future production implementation.

