| Programming language | Python 3.12+ |
| Backend framework | Django 5.2 LTS |
| Frontend rendering | Django templates |
| UI framework | Bootstrap 5 |
| Styling | Custom CSS variables |
| Interactivity | Vanilla JavaScript |
